      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Four-bedroom detached dormer bungalow with a B energy rating, extending to approximately 1,710 sq.ft(159 sq. m), complemented by a detached block-built garage\n•Well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, guest WC, living room, home office/playroom, extended open-plan kitchen/dining and lounge area, utility room, four bedrooms (including a principal en-suite), and family bathroom\n•Substantial block-built garage to rear, wired, offering excellent storage or workshop potential\n•Private rear garden, seating/BBQ area beneath a glass Perspex canopy, raised beds and tarmacadam yard\n•Just minutes from the vibrant university town of Maynooth, offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, and highly regarded primary and secondary schools\n•Superb commuter location with a bus stop on the doorstep, Maynooth Railway Station just minutes away, and convenient access to the M4 motorway for easy travel to Dublin and beyond\n\n\nGuide Price\n695,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nTarmacadam driveway with double cast iron gated entrance, pebble dash pillars and caps, and lawn to the front.\n\nEntrance Hallway 2.00m x 9.00m\nTiled flooring with hardwood staircase to the first floor, generous proportions providing access to principal reception rooms.\n\nGuest W.C. 1.27m x 2.00m\nW.c., w.h.b. and towel radiator, tiled flooring with semi-tiled walls.\n\nLiving Room 4.67m x 4.91m\nCoving with feature fireplace with marble surround, double doors leading through to the open-plan kitchen and lounge area.\n\nHome Office/Playroom 2.80m x 3.16m\nTiled flooring with access to the entrance hallway, currently used as a home office/playroom.\n\nKitchen//Lounge (open-plan) 4.80m x 8.30m\nFeature pellet burner set within a brick surround, tiled flooring with coving and downlights throughout. Fully fitted kitchen with additional cabinet units, soft close drawers, tiled splashback, built-in oven and grill, and French doors leading out to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room 1.86m x 3.20m\nTiled flooring with recessed space for an American style fridge freezer, plumbed for washing machine, additional kitchen cabinet units and worktop area, and fuse box. Door leading out to the rear with block-built storage shed to side.\n\nLanding 1.10m x 7.50m\nSemi-solid flooring, providing access to all first-floor bedrooms and family bathroom.\n\nMaster Bedroom 4.73m x 4.48m\nFitted sliding robes with semi-solid flooring.\n\nEnsuite 1.66m x 2.34m\nCorner Triton shower, w.c., w.h.b. with integrated cabinet, and Velux window.\n\nBedroom 2 2.89m x 3.10m\nSemi-solid flooring with feature window.\n\nBedroom 3 3.11m x 3.53m\nAdditional sockets and feature window, semi-solid flooring throughout.\n\nBedroom 4 3.10m x 4.31m\nSemi-solid flooring with additional sockets, TV point and hotpress.\n\nFamily Bathroom 3.38m x 2.32m\nTiled flooring with tiled walls throughout, corner bath unit, corner shower with Triton electric shower, w.c., w.h.b. with integrated vanity cabinet and mirror, shaving light, towel radiator and feature window.\n\nGarden\nRear garden with pergola & bbq area, tarmacadam yard with raised beds, edging and sleepers and side entrance housing an enclosed oil boiler and oil tank. \n\nBlock Built Garage 11m x 6.60m\nWired. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area - approximately 1,710 sq.ft(159 sq. m)\nBuilt in 2002\nFully alarmed \nExternal power points\nTap\n\nItems Included in sale:\nFixtures, fittings, window dressings, dishwasher, oven & hob.\n\nServices\nMains water\nOil fired central heating \nBio cycle \n\nBER \nB\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 C3K0\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nJill Wright \n016286128\n\n"
      },
